<title>FRANCE: France sells soft wheat flour to Egypt as food aid.</title>
<headline>France sells soft wheat flour to Egypt as food aid.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>France sold a total of 32,846 tonnes of soft wheat flour to Egypt in a food aid tender it held on December 5, France's grain office ONIC said.</p>
<p>It sold 16,423 tonnes of flour at 1,575 francs per tonne fob Rouen, and another 16,423 tonnes at 1,575 francs per tonne fob Boulogne-Sur-Mer.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
